# Build briefs and working notes (internal, not part of the site). Mirrors the
# same patterns the app repo ignores — these are how a feature was reasoned
# about, not a description of what shipped, so when they disagree with the
# HTML, the HTML is right. phase4-pricing-prompt.txt is the one in this repo.
*-prompt.txt
*_SPEC.txt
*_REVIEW.txt

# Vercel CLI local state
.vercel

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
*.sw?

# Deliberately NOT ignored here: node_modules, dist, .env. This site is
# hand-written static HTML with inline styles — no package.json, no build step,
# no secrets. Add those rules if that ever stops being true.
